{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\ntypedef long long ll;\ntypedef struct Frac { ll p, q; } Frac;\n\nvoid abs_sub(Frac a, Frac b, Frac* out) {\n    ll l = lcm(a.q, b.q);\n    ll na = a.p * (l / a.q);\n    ll nb = b.p * (l / b.q);\n    ll d = na - nb;\n    if (d < 0) d = -d;\n    ll g = gcd(d, l);\n    out->p = d / g;\n    out->q = l / g;\n}\n\nint cmp(Frac a, Frac b) {\n    ll l = lcm(a.q, b.q);\n    ll na = a.p * (l / a.q);\n    ll nb = b.p * (l / b.q);\n    if (na == nb) return 0;\n    return na < nb ? -1 : 1;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    ios_base::sync_with_stdio(false), cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    ll x, y, n;\n    cin >> x >> y >> n;\n\n    ll g = gcd(x, y);\n    x /= g;\n    y /= g;\n\n    Frac target = {x, y};\n    Frac bestDiff = {1000000000000LL, 1};\n    Frac best = {0, 0};\n\n    for (ll b = 1; b <= n; ++b) {\n        ll l = 0;\n        double bound = (double)x / y + (double)bestDiff.p / bestDiff.q;\n        ll r = (ll)((bound + 2.0) * (double)b);\n\n        while (l <= r) {\n            ll mid = l + (r - l) / 2;\n            Frac cand = {mid, b};\n            Frac diff;\n            abs_sub(target, cand, &diff);\n\n            int c = cmp(diff, bestDiff);\n            if (c == 0) {\n                if (cand.q < best.q || (cand.q == best.q && cand.p < best.p))\n                    best = cand;\n            } else if (c < 0) {\n                bestDiff = diff;\n                best = cand;\n            }\n\n            if (cmp(cand, target) < 0)\n                l = mid + 1;\n            else\n                r = mid - 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    cout << best.p << \"/\" << best.q;\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static class Frac {\n        long p, q;\n        Frac(long p, long q) {\n            this.p = p;\n            this.q = q;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static long gcd(long a, long b) {\n        while (b != 0) {\n            long t = b;\n            b = a % b;\n            a = t;\n        }\n        return a;\n    }\n\n    static long lcm(long a, long b) {\n        return a / gcd(a, b) * b;\n    }\n\n    static void absSub(Frac a, Frac b, Frac out) {\n        long l = lcm(a.q, b.q);\n        long na = a.p * (l / a.q);\n        long nb = b.p * (l / b.q);\n        long d = na - nb;\n        if (d < 0) d = -d;\n        long g = gcd(d, l);\n        out.p = d / g;\n        out.q = l / g;\n    }\n\n    static int cmp(Frac a, Frac b) {\n        long l = lcm(a.q, b.q);\n        long na = a.p * (l / a.q);\n        long nb = b.p * (l / b.q);\n        if (na == nb) return 0;\n        return na < nb ? -1 : 1;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long x = sc.nextLong();\n        long y = sc.nextLong();\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n\n        long g = gcd(x, y);\n        x /= g;\n        y /= g;\n\n        Frac target = new Frac(x, y);\n        Frac bestDiff = new Frac(1000000000000L, 1);\n        Frac best = new Frac(0, 0);\n\n        for (long b = 1; b <= n; ++b) {\n            long l = 0;\n            double bound = (double) x / y + (double) bestDiff.p / bestDiff.q;\n            long r = (long) ((bound + 2.0) * (double) b);\n\n            while (l <= r) {\n                long mid = l + (r - l) / 2;\n                Frac cand = new Frac(mid, b);\n                Frac diff = new Frac(0, 0);\n                absSub(target, cand, diff);\n\n                int c = cmp(diff, bestDiff);\n                if (c == 0) {\n                    if (cand.q < best.q || (cand.q == best.q && cand.p < best.p))\n                        best = cand;\n                } else if (c < 0) {\n                    bestDiff = diff;\n                    best = cand;\n                }\n\n                if (cmp(cand, target) < 0)\n                    l = mid + 1;\n                else\n                    r = mid - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(best.p + \"/\" + best.q);\n        sc.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.1920928244535389e-07, -6.329813186312094e-05, -4.768360213347478e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.0003573255962692201, -0.03044920600950718, -0.0067374915815889835, -0.0007128558354452252, 0.0, -0.007857603952288628, -0.01815745420753956, -0.004081373102962971, -0.0013049667468294501, -0.38695934414863586, -1.3351351299206726e-05, 0.0, -2.9801878554280847e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -9.536738616588991e-07, 0.0, -0.00021026308240834624, 0.0, -0.0005722792120650411, -2.2053474822314456e-05, -2.1457441107486375e-05, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.00043585337698459625, -4.291525328881107e-06, -5.1973900554003194e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -0.38687101006507874, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -5.030505417380482e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -5.173549288883805e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 